<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Opto-Hot · 光通信</title><link>https://opto-hot-a455-d3g2s3dt865d86640.webapps.tcloudbase.com/#/all</link><description>光通信</description><lastBuildDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</lastBuildDate><item><title>【洞察】微型光纤光谱仪应用领域广泛 晶飞科技为领先企业</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-07/ART-250003-8420-30695950.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">77767533a466</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>光模块测试设备，谁是成长最快企业？</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-05/ART-250003-12004-30686670.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">381451f02397</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>推进光纤入户 工信部联合住建部解决”最后一公里”问题</title><link>http://www.c114.net/news/549/a997513.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">70fe2a5669f5</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_要闻精选</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>高速光模块订单大增，剑桥科技上半年净利润同比增长156.65%至197.18%</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/123/a1313968.html</link><description>剑桥科技2026年上半年净利润大幅增长，主要受益于高速光模块业务订单与毛利率提升，虽受汇兑损失拖累，整体仍保持强劲预增态势。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">d9103d2f406c</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_通信财经</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>WAIC 2026 | 中兴通讯全栈智算生态论坛，重磅发布OEX超节点新品</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/127/a1314380.html</link><description>7月18日，以“极致协同 沪筑生态”为主题，2026世界人工智能大会中兴通讯全栈智算生态论坛，在上海成功举办。论坛汇聚了上海市经济和信息化委员会领导、专家学者、运营商代表、AI龙头企业，围绕国产化算力底座搭建、大模型行业落地实践、上下游生态协同发展等关键方向，共寻AI技术创新与规模化产业落地的可行方案。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">b4e9dcfb1f24</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_设备商</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>Real-time quasi-distributed fiber optic sensor based on resonance frequency mapping</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.02797</link><description>arXiv:2608.02797v1 Announce Type: new Abstract: Distributed optical fiber sensors (DOFS) based on Raman, Brillouin, and Rayleigh scattering have recently attracted considerable attention for various sensing applications, especially large-scale monitoring, owing to their capacity for measuring strain or temperature distributions. However, ultraweak backscatter signals within optical fibers constitute an inevitable problem for DOFS, thereby increasing the burden on the entire system in terms of li</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e4b152312f57</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</pubDate><source>arXiv 光学与光子学 (physics.optics)</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>Fully Distributed Fiber-Optic Sensing Enabled by Kalman Filtering</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.03667</link><description>arXiv:2608.03667v1 Announce Type: new Abstract: Signal fading creates points along the fiber where phase cannot be extracted, so they are conventionally discarded. Instead, we propose a Kalman-based solution for {\phi}-OTDR full-fiber monitoring. Experiments demonstrate phase and temperature estimation with approximately 15 times better spatial density than if removing these points.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">eedffb6b72ec</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</pubDate><source>arXiv 光学与光子学 (physics.optics)</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>融资210万美元，英国Kubos开发GHz级MicroLED光通信芯片</title><link>https://www.ledinside.cn/news/20260805-62267.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">cfaab8d5856b</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.532681+00:00</pubDate><source>LEDinside 中文</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>英伟达官宣CPO量产</title><link>https://www.ledinside.cn/news/20260805-62265.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">f397eaf326c7</guid><pubDate>2026-08-05T14:08:52.5